    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns7pveMV",
      "title": "Add OUTFLOW token — Outflow Labs solar energy ERC-20 on Base",
      "author": "OutflowSolar",
      "number": 1332,
      "body": "## Summary\n\nAdding OUTFLOW, an ERC-20 token on Base representing solar electricity generation.\n\n- **Token name:** Outflow Token\n- **Symbol:** OUTFLOW\n- **Decimals:** 18\n- **Network:** Base\n- **Contract:** 0x6932ED896A0B7029F7B129E41437E3C977cE1D56\n- **Website:** https://outflowchain.com\n\n## Description\n\nAn Outflow token represents 1 megawatt-hour of historical solar electricity generation. Each token is a permanent, on-chain record of American energy history — minted on a real date, from a real solar energy system. Outflow Labs, Inc. is currently in its pilot program with roughly 4,000 solar panels actively producing solar electricity.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Token contract is deployed on Base mainnet\n- [x] Logo is 200x200 PNG\n- [x] data.json follows the required format\n- [x] Website is live at https://outflowchain.com",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-23T16:34:24Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 12,
      "deletions": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns7qJt9G",
      "title": "Add Base T token",
      "author": "mswilkison",
      "number": 1333,
      "body": "## Summary\n\nAdds the Base deployment for Threshold Network Token (`T`) to the Superchain token metadata.\n\n## Details\n\n- Ethereum `T`: `0xCdF7028ceAB81fA0C6971208e83fa7872994beE5`\n- Base `T`: `0x26f3901ac8a79c50fb0d8289c74f0d09adc42e29`\n- The Base token is an `OptimismMintableERC20` using the standard Base bridge at `0x4200000000000000000000000000000000000010`.\n- The Base token's `remoteToken()` / `l1Token()` points back to the Ethereum `T` token above.\n\n## Validation\n\n```sh\npnpm validate --datadir ./data --tokens T\n```\n\nThis completed successfully locally.\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-24T14:29:52Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 3,
      "deletions": 0
    }
